# Try the Risk checks API from VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request".
# Start the API first:  dotnet run --project src/RSC.Api
@api = http://localhost:5024/api/riskchecks

### LIST all, newest first
GET {{api}}

### FILTER: high risk, user not yet notified
GET {{api}}?minScore=70&notified=false

### FIND one
GET {{api}}/1

### ADD (valid)
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listingId": 2, "riskScore": 66, "flags": "Landlord asks for deposit before viewing", "reviewNote": null, "checkedDate": "2026-10-29", "userNotified": false }

### ADD (invalid: score 101) -> 400 with the error message
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listingId": 2, "riskScore": 101, "flags": "Test", "checkedDate": "2026-10-29", "userNotified": false }

### EDIT
PUT {{api}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listingId": 1, "riskScore": 88, "flags": "Rent 58% below area average; asks to pay deposit before viewing", "reviewNote": "Checked again", "checkedDate": "2026-10-01", "userNotified": true }

### DELETE (use an ID you added above)
DELETE {{api}}/11
